# Corpse Explosion compatibility scenario (0.113.1)
# Starts a standard Ironclad run, jumps to a 3-slug fight, applies the mod power to
# enemy 1, kills enemy 0, and probes HP before/after. If the death hook works, the
# other two slugs die from Max HP damage and combat ends.

fight CORPSE_SLUGS_NORMAL
wait combat-started
ce_probe
card OUTBREAK
ce_probe
power CORPSE_EXPLOSION_POWER 1 1
ce_probe
kill 0
wait 3
ce_probe
